- Add canonical '/' to the homepage (root canonical was removed in earlier PR1 commits, leaving / without one)
- N-03 ProductGallery: manual thumbnail pick holds until the variation changes; derived during render, no effect
- N-05 MobileMenu: client component; closes on navigation and Escape, returns focus to toggle
- N-06 OfferTabs: filter buttons with aria-pressed instead of incomplete tab semantics; polite status text
- N-04 Contact form + product page: prefilled mailto handoff (body capped at 1500 chars); submit still never claims delivery
